    {
      "id": "yCnT",
      "code_hash": "a662eed5b3af57495211fd11b7f8ead1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h2 id=\"recap\">\ud83e\udded Recap</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An optimizer <strong>follows the forces downhill</strong> until the largest force falls below <code>fmax</code>.</li>\n<li>The step size matters: steepest descent with too large a step <strong>overshoots and diverges</strong>.\n  Smarter optimizers (BFGS, FIRE, \u2026) adapt automatically.</li>\n<li>Local optimizers find the <strong>nearest minimum</strong>, which isn't always the global one.</li>\n<li>For crystals, the <strong>cell</strong> must be relaxed too, using a filter like <code>FrechetCellFilter</code>. Symmetry alone\n  can make atomic forces vanish in a badly strained crystal.</li>\n<li>A universal ML potential like <strong>UMA</strong> makes all of this fast enough to explore interactively. Pick the\n  task head that matches your system (<code>omol</code> for molecules, <code>omat</code> for inorganic crystals).\n  For publication-quality numbers, it's common to refine the final structure with DFT.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"things-to-try\">\ud83e\uddea Things to try</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Set the shake strength to <strong>0.4 \u00c5</strong> on ethanol and check the bond table: did a bond break or the molecule change conformer?</li>\n<li>In the race, tighten <code>fmax</code> to <strong>0.005</strong> and see which optimizer struggles most near the end.</li>\n<li>Relax all six crystals in section 4 and compare with experiment. The <code>omat</code> head learned PBE, which\n   tends to <strong>overestimate</strong> lattice constants by about 1%. Does UMA follow that trend?</li>\n<li>Compress <strong>NaCl</strong> by \u22128% and watch how hard it pushes back compared with <strong>tungsten</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"cheat-sheet\">\ud83d\udccb Cheat sheet</h3>\n<div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">ase.build</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">molecule</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">bulk</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">ase.optimize</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">BFGS</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">ase.filters</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">FrechetCellFilter</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">ase.io</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">write</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">fairchem.core</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">FAIRChemCalculator</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">pretrained_mlip</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">torch</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># needs a Hugging Face token with UMA access: set HF_TOKEN or run `hf auth login`</span>\n<span class=\"n\">device</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"cuda\"</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">torch</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cuda</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_available</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"cpu\"</span>\n<span class=\"n\">predictor</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">pretrained_mlip</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_predict_unit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"uma-s-1p2p1\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">device</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Molecule: relax atomic positions</span>\n<span class=\"n\">mol</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">molecule</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"CH3CH2OH\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">mol</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">info</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">update</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">charge</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">spin</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>          <span class=\"c1\"># neutral singlet</span>\n<span class=\"n\">mol</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">calc</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">FAIRChemCalculator</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">predictor</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">task_name</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"omol\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">BFGS</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mol</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">trajectory</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"ethanol.traj\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">fmax</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">0.02</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>   <span class=\"c1\"># view with: ase gui ethanol.traj</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Crystal: relax positions + cell</span>\n<span class=\"n\">si</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">bulk</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Si\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"diamond\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">5.6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">cubic</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"kc\">True</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">si</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">calc</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">FAIRChemCalculator</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">predictor</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">task_name</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"omat\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">BFGS</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">FrechetCellFilter</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">si</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">fmax</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mf\">0.01</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">si</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cell</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cellpar</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n<span class=\"n\">write</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"si_relaxed.cif\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">si</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><em>UMA: <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/facebook/UMA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">huggingface.co/facebook/UMA</a> \u00b7\nfairchem: <a href=\"https://github.com/facebookresearch/fairchem\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">github.com/facebookresearch/fairchem</a> \u00b7\nASE optimizers: <a href=\"https://wiki.fysik.dtu.dk/ase/ase/optimize.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">ASE documentation</a></em></span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    }
  ]
}